OL,3,AMilder day in store before more cold
OL,4,Ahealth alerts take effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother round of cold health alerts is
OL,7,Fset to come into force on Sunday
OL,8,Ffollowing a brief break from the
OL,9,Fweekend's subzero temperatures.
OL,11,FAfter readings dipped as low as minus
OL,12,F7C early on Saturday, most places on
OL,13,FSunday morning were milder and free of
OL,14,Ffrost.
OL,16,FWidespread rainfall will put a dampener
OL,17,Fon any outdoor plans, however, with
OL,18,Fhail and thunderstorms possible for
OL,19,Fparts of Wales and southern England.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
